{"product_id":"searching-for-grace-kelly","title":"Searching For Grace Kelly","description":"\u003cp\u003eFor a small-town girl with big-city dreams, there is no address more glamorous than New York’s Barbizon Hotel. Laura, a patrician beauty from Smith, arrives to work at Mademoiselle for the summer. Her hopelessly romantic roommate, Dolly, comes from a working-class upstate town to attend secretarial school. Vivian, a brash British bombshell with a disregard for the hotel’s rules, rounds out the trio of friends. Together, the girls embark on a journey of discovery that will take them from the penthouse apartments of Park Avenue to the Beat scene of Greenwich Village to Atlantic City’s Steel Pier — and into the arms of very different men who will alter their lives forever.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:22 x 196  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: M.G. Callahan \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780751560084 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 368\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44768312426649,"sku":"5RF9780751560084","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/0acb3af210f28ac60f6739c7f7817ae0.jpg?v=1724235470","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/searching-for-grace-kelly","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}